<title>CHINA: China July trade surplus at $2.76 billion-customs.</title>
<headline>China July trade surplus at $2.76 billion-customs.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's trade surplus for July alone was $2.76 billion compared with $1.082 billion for the year-ago period, customs officials said on Friday.</p>
<p>		July 1997	 July 1996</p>
<p> Exports     15.58		12.388</p>
<p> Imports     12.82		11.306</p>
<p> Balance    + 2.76	     + 1.082</p>
<p>(figures in billions of dollars)</p>
</text>
